### FilmFuse core-api - movie catalog (Discover)
# Token: see me.http. Without TMDB_ACCESS_TOKEN core-api serves the offline fixture catalog
# (~50 well-known movies), so these work with no TMDB account.
# Cursors are opaque: pass back the previous response's nextCursor; null means the last page.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Genres (19, sorted by name)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/genres
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by title
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/search?q=matrix
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search, next page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/search?q=the&cursor=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing / blank / >100 char q -> 400 with fieldErrors.q
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/search?q=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Popular
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/popular
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Popular in a genre (27 = Horror), page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/popular?genre=27&cursor=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown genre -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/popular?genre=12345
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Movie details (550 = Fight Club); served from app.movies for 7 days once fetched
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/550
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown movie -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Non-numeric id -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/movies/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
